  m_text: "\n\n\n<size=90>Reverse Engineered by\n<size=180>Juelz I\n\n<size=90>Designed
    by\n<size=180>SBN3 Studios\n\n<size=80>Developed By\n<size=120>EmmyDev for Frogga
    Games AB\n\n<size=40>\n<size=60>Written & Directed by\n<size=100>Max Field\n\n<size=50>Featuring
    the voicework of\n<size=80>Elsie Lovelock <size=40>as NICOLE\n<size=80>Kayli
    Mills <size=40>as JECKA\n<size=80>Stuart Zagnit <size=40>as THE PUZZLER\n<size=80>Valerie
    Rose Lohman <size=40>as EMILY\n<size=80>Kira Buckland <size=40>as ARI\n<size=80>Max
    Field <size=40>as KYLAR, JEFFERY, CRISPIN\n<size=80>Dreux Ferrano Jr. <size=40>as
    COACH COLBY\n<size=80>Connor Quinn <size=40>as COP\n<size=76>Sarah Ruth Thomas
    <size=40>as PRINCIPAL LYNN\n<size=80>Don McDonald <size=40>as JECKA'S DAD\n<size=80>Anne
    Yatco <size=40>as MS. AMES\n<size=80>Michael Potok <size=40>as HUNTER\n<size=80>Corinne
    Sudberg <size=40>as KAREN\n<size=80>Gary Scales <size=40>as TRACK PA\n<size=80>\n<size=60>Lead
    Illustrator\n<size=100>KuroiDa\n<size=40>\n<size=60>Soundtrack Composer\n<size=100>Aaron
    MrLab Monroe\n\n<size=60>Cutscene Animation\n<size=90>Chuckle Mouse Studio\nStudio
    inkfish\nStudio Adventure Noises\n<size=76>Aldo Mita\nMarushi\nTiphanie Erickson\nGiuseppe
    Bonanno\nYamato\nLuxe\n\n<size=72>Cutscene BG art\n<size=100>Haku\n\n<size=72>3D
    Elements\n<size=100>Vincentius Sesarius\n\n<size=72>Additional VFX\n<size=100>Shawn
    Smith\n\n<size=72>CG Illustrators\n<size=100>KuroiDa\nNarukamiTooru\nGNbulldozer\nKensei\nAkinobu
    Takechi\nGMG\nPupe Potato\nApril\n\n<size=72>Background Art\n<size=100>OZK\n\n<size=72>Lead
    Programmer\n<size=100>Emmy Hammarstr\xF6m\n\n<size=72>Enemy AI + Additional Programming\n<size=100>Sam
    Ahlbom\n\n<size=60>Technical Consultants\n<size=72>CardsOfTheHeart\n<size=72>Nicholas
    Taylor \"WizardPerson\"\n\n<size=60>Special Thanks to\n<size=72>Brian \"xandad\"
    Oliver\nPeesh san\n\n       ."
