    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\n\n\n\n<size=50>If you liked this puzzle game and are wondering where
    the hell all these wild characters came from you should\n<size=72><color=#0F00FF><link=\"https://store.steampowered.com/bundle/48318/Class_of_09_Trey_Pack/\">buy
    Class of '09: The Trey Pack!</link></color>\n<size=50>The original visual novel
    trilogy which introduced us to Nicole, Jecka, and everyone else.\n\n\n\n\n<size=50>Some
    story and character elements of this video game are based on real events, encounters,
    and personalities. Any content viewed as offensive is a reflection of American
    culture and not endorsed by Class of '09 or it's staff. All characters depicted
    are 18+. Any products, brand names, logos, and any other proprietary designations
    mentioned in this video game are the property of their respective owners. The
    inclusion of these items is for illustrative purposes only and does not imply
    endorsement or affiliation with the owners. The use of any trademarks, service
    marks, or trade names strictly pertains to cultural reference within the context
    of historical fiction and does not suggest sponsorship or approval by the trademark
    owner.\n\n\nClass of '09 is a registered trademark and under the ownership of
    SBN3 Studios\nClass of '09: Puzzle Showdown is a property within the Class of
    '09 franchise.\n\n\n       ."
